 "sentences": [
  "These butterflies cover thousands of miles!",
  "Eastern monarchs migrate south in late summer from the US and Canada.",
  "Their wings span 8.9 to 10.2 cm with a black, orange, and white pattern.",
  "They are iconic pollinators, although not especially effective pollinators of milkweeds.",
  "The viceroy butterfly mimics them, but is smaller with an extra black stripe.",
  "A multigenerational return brings them back north in spring."
